Z||000010||pontiacs4me||08-22-2001||01:32 AM||||You smell both right on.  I plan on a T3-T04e hybrid turbo with about 10psi (street) and 15 psi (strip) of intercooled boost.  Along with about a 50 shot in case this pesky 95 rt/10 viper, I see driving around almost daily, wants to play. I was just wondering what the engine would make naturally aspirated, so I can figure what to expect when I put the turbo on it.  I was hoping with my combo to make about 205-210 horse at the crank w/o the turbo, and about 310-320 with it.  Then a 50 shot and holy crap this car is going to be fun.||||reg||1
